Name "Server Hosting Business"
Author "Deathskills + Claude"
Description "Turns server hosting into a real business line. Every OS, plus antivirus and office software with Network, now needs bandwidth that grows with each era, and Multiplayer and MMO games use much more. AI companies ask you to host older products too once they need 100 Mbps or more, and hosting deals pay ISP and power plus a fixed profit per Mbps. Requires 0HarmonyLoader. Start a new game; not meant for existing saves."
